full_description:
If you are an entrepreneur yourself, you are welcome to discuss cooperation.

Job Title
Remote Startup Founder for Online Pitch Event
Job Description
We organize global online innovation pitch events for industrial parks and startup competitions. We are currently seeking authentic overseas startup founders to deliver 10–15-minute online pitches in English via video call.
1. Conduct a complete project presentation remotely and participate in a Q&A session with the judges;
2. Provide a complete English-language business plan and presentation slides for review prior to the pitch;
3. Receive a fixed fee per session, payable after the event concludes;
4. Terms of Agreement: We may use de-identified project materials and recorded pitch videos for event promotion and industry networking (personal contact information will be hidden, and you retain 100% ownership of the project’s intellectual property).
Eligibility Requirements
1. A genuine, independent startup with verifiable market, technical, and revenue data;
2. A stable internet connection capable of supporting video conferencing;
3. Flexible schedule, with the ability to confirm the roadshow date in advance.
